('incline-barbell-press','Incline Barbell Press','chest','{shoulders,triceps}','barbell','{gym}','intermediate',true,'On a 30-degree incline bench, lower the bar to the upper chest and press up.','{"Do not let elbows flare past 60 degrees","Drive feet into the floor"}'),
('dumbbell-bench-press','Dumbbell Bench Press','chest','{triceps,shoulders}','dumbbells','{gym,home}','beginner',true,'Lie flat holding dumbbells at chest height, press up until arms are extended.','{"Lower until you feel a stretch, not pain","Keep a slight arch in the lower back"}'),
