('dumbbell-fly','Dumbbell Fly','chest','{shoulders}','dumbbells','{gym,home}','intermediate',false,'With a soft elbow bend, open the arms wide then hug them back together above the chest.','{"Think hugging a barrel","Stop when you feel the stretch"}'),
